<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms seek 15,500T of Indian soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms seek 15,500T of Indian soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed mill companies, including Miwon Co Ltd, Woo Sung Feed Mill Co Ltd and Purina Korea, have invited tenders for 15,500 tonnes of Indian soymeal by 0300 GMT on Wednesday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 20 to January 20 to the western port city of Kunsan, traders said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
